commit 41ad43d599afa312fbf5b51a8cfa2feebb670565
Author: Digital Trekkerr <support@digitaltrekkerr.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 26 17:18:26 2026 +0300

    Harden CI, factor shared Markdown helpers, share Dio factory
    
    • CI (release.yml): SHA-pin flutter-action@v2.23.0 and action-gh-release@v2.6.2;
      add --split-per-abi and publish one APK per ABI (armeabi-v7a, arm64-v8a,
      x86_64) instead of a single fat APK. Smaller per-device downloads.
    
    • markdown_renderer: extract MarkdownView helpers (handleMarkdownLinkTap,
      buildBaseMarkdownStyleSheet) into a top-level module so BiDiMarkdownView
      can reuse them. Removes 106 duplicated lines in markdown_view.dart.
    
    • translation_core: expose a single dio_factory() (10s connect, 120s receive,
      30s send) used by all HTTP-using providers. 20 new tests covering the
      per-phase timeouts and the no-base-options guard.

